{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962840/extras/8e905e7e4670213538fd8e3decd9649a.avif?t=1773236285\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A choice-driven visual novel where you delve into the lives of a young, attractive couple. Embark on daily adventures, together and/or separately. Temptation is always just around the corner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You play as &quot;<strong>Tony&quot;,</strong>\u00a0a guy who's fantasized about sharing his wife for a number of years. A while back, it was brought up during a conversation, and Anne thought that was weird. So nothing more was spoken of it.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962840/extras/8c8b85b606f4c6b9a764e26eb950fb7c.avif?t=1773236285\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962840/extras_big/8c8b85b606f4c6b9a764e26eb950fb7c.webp?t=1773236285 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recently, though, Anne has also mentioned on a couple of occasions that their sex life needs a little spicing up.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962840/extras/450e288f5a84145af069da4c721901d7.avif?t=1773236285\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anne</strong> is a true exhibitionist, she loves being admired and showing off her delicious assets. Tony has always loved the attention she gets and that has ignited the fire within him to want to share her.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962840/extras/91128556005d2fba49d2c6459b957b07.avif?t=1773236285\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962840/extras_big/91128556005d2fba49d2c6459b957b07.webp?t=1773236285 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throughout the game, you will make the decisions for &quot;Tony&quot;; some of Anne's decisions will be made by previous choices or by stats, and some will also be made by you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962840/extras/87ebb85bb0b50119f5b0fbdce44b97b1.avif?t=1773236285\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962840/extras_big/87ebb85bb0b50119f5b0fbdce44b97b1.webp?t=1773236285 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are so many avenues and branches that a single playthrough will not suffice.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take your time and enjoy The Adventurous Couple's sexual escapades.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962840?t=1773236285","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962840?t=1773236285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962840/a2c90aa494c7a8f6a41a27627ad923eba69886c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773236285","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962840/a2c90aa494c7a8f6a41a27627ad923eba69886c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773236285","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],